  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Dodge this.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Any marksmanship technique with called shot in its name, marksmanship as a chosen triggerman specialization, triggerman level 7th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you execute a technique with \"called shot\" in its name and miss with your attack used to deliver it, you may redirect your attack to a creature that is adjacent to your original target. If you do, and if your original roll would hit this new target at a -4 penalty, you hit your new target. This ability may be used three times per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/triggerman-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
